what A round-open RELEASES a live build's lock, proven on metal this lap. tools/fixtures/s/shell_portable.sh lock_acquire holds a build lock as the DIRECTORY -- mkdir is its atomic test-and-set -- and writes pid inside it; tools/fixtures/r/rye_build.sh takes one per room because %734 found two builds in one room writing the same shadow .zig names. git stash push -u sweeps untracked files and passes over IGNORED ones, and .gitignore names no build-lock pattern, so tools/f/fleet_round_open.sh removes the whole .rye-build.lock directory at every lap open. Tested in a throwaway repository: after git stash push -u the lock directory, its pid, and the room are all gone, so a second build mkdirs the lock successfully and enters the room the lock exists to serialize. Reachable rather than theoretical: standing_equipment_run.sh --detach builds in the background, this lap launched one, and three lock pids stand in this ship's dead-letter box right now -- amphora, amphora/src, mikrophone. This is REDS %805's own deferred half, which priced the unignored pattern as a re-tracking risk at the next git add -A and sent the ignore question to the card. The price is now measured and it is correctness rather than hygiene. The cure is the one this tree already applied to its other two locks: .gitignore names /lotus/.sing.lock/ for the choir and construction/standing-equipment-run.lock.d/ for the run, each with a comment naming its tool and reason, and the build lock born at %734 is the one never named -- a pattern rather than a path, since it appears in whatever room a build writes. Second consequence in the same root: stash_record_scan.sh partitions orphans into shelf and work, a lock pid has no third class, and orphans_work reads 3 with all three transient -- 100 percent false on the one counter its own header calls the only one worth a lap, which is the work drawer reading false a second time after the renamed-draft class. Ledger half: the pin is deadlocked 65,534 of 65,536 with 0 of 22 foldable, and reds_pin_capacity_scan.sh names a fourth door the card never asked Keaton -- prove one repair on metal and accrete that row's marker to BOOKED. Take it on %801, pushed testimony never to be forced, guards GREEN, remainder a named fleet question.
